sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Staff as Staff<br/>POS
  participant BFF as BFF<br/>auth guards
  participant Order as Order<br/>order owner
  participant ODB as PostgreSQL<br/>Order DB
  participant Catalog as Catalog<br/>stock owner
  participant CDB as PostgreSQL<br/>Catalog DB
  participant Outbox as Order<br/>Outbox relay
  participant Kafka as Kafka<br/>order.confirmed

  Staff->>BFF: Confirm pending order
  BFF->>BFF: Verify JWT, tenant, permission
  BFF->>Order: Confirm order
  Order->>ODB: Lock order in tenant scope

  alt Order already PROCESSING
    ODB-->>Order: Existing confirmed state
    Order-->>BFF: Idempotent confirmation response
  else Order is PENDING and bill is OPEN
    Order->>ODB: Load order items and bill in tenant scope
    Order->>Catalog: Request stock deduction
    Catalog->>CDB: Lock and update owned stock rows
    alt Stock is sufficient
      Catalog->>CDB: Deduct stock and update item status
      Catalog-->>Order: Stock deduction accepted
      Order->>ODB: Set order/items PROCESSING
      Order->>ODB: Insert outbox event order.confirmed
      alt Order DB commit succeeds
        ODB-->>Order: Commit Order transaction
        Order-->>BFF: Confirmation success
        BFF-->>Staff: Confirmation success
        Outbox->>ODB: Poll pending outbox row
        Outbox->>Kafka: Publish topic order.confirmed
      else Order DB update or outbox fails
        ODB--xOrder: Roll back Order transaction
        Order->>Catalog: Release stock as compensation
        Catalog->>CDB: Release previously deducted stock
        Catalog-->>Order: Compensation result
        Order-->>BFF: Structured failure from original error
        BFF-->>Staff: Show confirmation failure
      end
    else Stock is insufficient
      Catalog-->>Order: Stock insufficient
      Order->>ODB: Roll back Order transaction
      Order-->>BFF: Structured conflict error
      BFF-->>Staff: Show stock error
    end
  else Invalid order or bill state
    Order-->>BFF: Invalid state response
    BFF-->>Staff: Show validation error
  end

  Note over Order,Catalog: Order never writes Catalog DB directly and compensation also goes through Catalog
